/-
# Lemma 3.6 at the `ClaimStar` level with **no** Engler–Prestel 3.4.3

Member `m7`, swarm `smw2qpqe7`, direction u7(b).

`QE/Lemma36Statement.lean`'s `lemma36_claim_star` derives Claim (⋆) for a unit `e` with
`rv(e)` transcendental over `K(Ŝ)` from the quotation `EPDimensionInequality`
(Engler–Prestel Thm 3.4.3).  `QE/UnitCase.lean` proved the elementary replacement of the
`Γ`-step (`ExpansionValMin` from residue transcendence at `vGammaValuation`) but stopped one
step short of the consumer: it produces `ResidualClasses`/`Standing` *for a named `T`*, not
`M8.ClaimStar S e`, and its §9 records the frozen↔Mathlib residue bridge as an unproved `Prop`.

This file closes the wiring gap: it assembles `M8.ClaimStar S e` — the exact conclusion of
`lemma36_claim_star` — from the elementary hypotheses, so EP 3.4.3 is *gone* from Lemma 3.6's
statement up to

  (R1) the value computation `ExpansionValMin S e` (proved in `QE/UnitCase.lean` from residue
       transcendence at the explicit valuation `vGammaValuation`, over the subfield `KOfS S`);
  (R2) the two structural facts about the extension that the paper also has —
       `M5L.QuotExpansions S ⟨Ŝ,e⟩ e` (`qe.tex:645`, "`VF(⟨Ŝ,e⟩)` is a quotient field of
       polynomial expansions") and `Assembly.IsVFGen ⟨Ŝ,e⟩` (Remark 3.1);
  (R3) `M5L.VFInvClosedOn S` — the paper's standing `Ŝ = ⟨VF(S)⟩` is a *field*, which the
       frozen `VF` sort (a ring: no inverse symbol) does not supply;
  (R4) the frozen↔Mathlib bridge `RVTransToResidueTranscendental` of `QE/UnitCase.lean` §9,
       which is *not* assumed here: it is an explicit hypothesis of the last theorem.

No `sorry`, no `axiom`, no `native_decide`; axiom audit at the end.
-/
import UnitCase

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option linter.unusedSectionVars false
set_option linter.style.haveILetI false
set_option maxHeartbeats 800000

open FirstOrder FirstOrder.Language
open SpecialTransformations.Milestone0
open SpecialTransformations.Milestone0.LRV
open SpecialTransformations.Milestone0.Transfer

namespace SpecialTransformations.Milestone0.M8

variable {M : Type} [LRV.Structure M] [hM : M ⊨ Axioms.ACVF]

/-! ## 1. `ClaimStar` from the value computation alone

This is the assembly that `QE/UnitCase.lean` stops one step short of: its
`ResidualClasses_of_VFGen_unit_min` and `M5L.standing_of_ClassControl` give the two components of
`ClaimStar` at `T = ⟨Ŝ,e⟩`. -/

/-- **Lemma 3.6's conclusion `ClaimStar S e` from the value computation.**  Hypotheses: the
paper's `Lemma36Hyp S e` (standing, `e ∈ U(M)`, `rv(e)` transcendental, `rv(e) ∈ RV(S)`), the
value computation `ExpansionValMin S e`, and the two structural facts about `⟨Ŝ,e⟩` plus
`VF`-inverse-closure of `S`.  No dimension inequality, no divisibility input beyond `Standing S`. -/
theorem lemma36_claim_star_of_expansionValMin {S : LRV.Substructure M} {e : M}
    (h : Lemma36Hyp S e) (hmin : ExpansionValMin (M := M) S e)
    (hquot : M5L.QuotExpansions S (Substructure.closure LRV ((S : Set M) ∪ {e})) e)
    (hfinv : M5L.VFInvClosedOn S)
    (hVFGen : Assembly.IsVFGen (Substructure.closure LRV ((S : Set M) ∪ {e}))) :
    ClaimStar S e := by
  have hrc : M5L.ResidualClasses S (Substructure.closure LRV ((S : Set M) ∪ {e})) :=
    ResidualClasses_of_VFGen_unit_min hmin h.unit hquot hfinv h.vf hVFGen
  exact ⟨hrc, M5L.standing_of_ClassControl (le_closure S e) h.standing hrc⟩

/-- The same, in the form `QE/Lemma36Statement.lean` produces it: from **residue transcendence at
the explicit valuation** `vGammaValuation` over the subfield `KOfS S` generated by `VF(Ŝ)`.  The
only difference from `lemma36_claim_star` is that the quoted `EPDimensionInequality` is replaced by
an elementary residue-field statement (`qe.tex:756`'s `vv(Σ b_i e^i) = min_i vv(b_i e^i)`, proved
from residue transcendence in `QE/UnitTranscend.lean` / `QE/UnitCase.lean` §8). -/
theorem lemma36_claim_star_of_residueTranscendental {S : LRV.Substructure M} {e : M}
    (h : Lemma36Hyp S e)
    (hT : M7.ResidueTranscendental (VGBridge.vGammaValuation (M := M)) (KOfS S)
      (vGamma_eq_one_of_units h.vf h.unit))
    (hquot : M5L.QuotExpansions S (Substructure.closure LRV ((S : Set M) ∪ {e})) e)
    (hfinv : M5L.VFInvClosedOn S)
    (hVFGen : Assembly.IsVFGen (Substructure.closure LRV ((S : Set M) ∪ {e}))) :
    ClaimStar S e :=
  lemma36_claim_star_of_expansionValMin h
    (ExpansionValMin_of_residueTranscendental h.vf h.unit hT) hquot hfinv hVFGen

/-- The same from the **frozen** residue transcendence `M8.RVTrans` plus the named bridge
`RVTransToResidueTranscendental` of `QE/UnitCase.lean` §9.  This is the quote-free Lemma 3.6 at
exactly the paper's own hypothesis `rv(e)` transcendental over `K(Ŝ)` — the bridge is the single
remaining translation, and it is a hypothesis here, not an assumption of the theorem. -/
theorem lemma36_claim_star_of_RVTrans {S : LRV.Substructure M} {e : M}
    (h : Lemma36Hyp S e)
    (hbridge : RVTransToResidueTranscendental (M := M) S e h.vf h.unit)
    (hquot : M5L.QuotExpansions S (Substructure.closure LRV ((S : Set M) ∪ {e})) e)
    (hfinv : M5L.VFInvClosedOn S)
    (hVFGen : Assembly.IsVFGen (Substructure.closure LRV ((S : Set M) ∪ {e}))) :
    ClaimStar S e :=
  lemma36_claim_star_of_residueTranscendental h (hbridge h.transc) hquot hfinv hVFGen

/-- **The two routes have the same conclusion.**  `QE/Lemma36Statement.lean`'s quoted route
(`hq : EPDimensionInequality`) and the elementary route of this file both produce `ClaimStar S e`
from `Lemma36Hyp S e`; the difference is confined to which extra data each route needs.  Recorded
so that a consumer of the `RelUnit` slot can swap them without changing shape. -/
theorem claimStar_routes_agree {S : LRV.Substructure M} {e : M}
    (hq : EPDimensionInequality) (h : Lemma36Hyp S e)
    (hmin : ExpansionValMin (M := M) S e)
    (hquot : M5L.QuotExpansions S (Substructure.closure LRV ((S : Set M) ∪ {e})) e)
    (hfinv : M5L.VFInvClosedOn S)
    (hVFGen : Assembly.IsVFGen (Substructure.closure LRV ((S : Set M) ∪ {e}))) :
    lemma36_claim_star hq h
      = lemma36_claim_star_of_expansionValMin h hmin hquot hfinv hVFGen :=
  Subsingleton.elim _ _

end SpecialTransformations.Milestone0.M8

/-! ## Axiom audit -/

#print axioms SpecialTransformations.Milestone0.M8.lemma36_claim_star_of_expansionValMin
#print axioms SpecialTransformations.Milestone0.M8.lemma36_claim_star_of_residueTranscendental
#print axioms SpecialTransformations.Milestone0.M8.lemma36_claim_star_of_RVTrans
#print axioms SpecialTransformations.Milestone0.M8.claimStar_routes_agree
